    core_synastry: `When one chart's Ceres meets another's Sun at trine, the Ceres-bearer's capacity to nurture and the Sun-bearer's sense of identity find each other in the same elemental family, moving in compatible directions. What the Ceres-bearer offers as care supports the Sun-bearer's becoming without overwhelming it, and the Sun-bearer's purpose gives the Ceres-bearer's care a meaningful place to land. The bond produces natural mutual nourishment.`,
