    core: `Ceres, the principle of nurturance, care, and the cycles of attachment and separation, fuses with the Moon, emotional instinct, interior need, and the body's pre-cognitive responses to safety and nourishment. When these two occupy the same degree, the experience of being cared for and the experience of emotional safety are the same experience. What feels safe is what feels nourishing. What feels nourishing is what feels like home. The emotional body and the caregiving function are not two separate systems. They are one integrated response to the question of what allows life to continue.`,
